# The release artifact is the component itself. `git archive` honours these, so
# the release tooling — and this file — never rides along into a user's machine.
# `.gitignore`/`pyproject.toml`/`tests/` stay: the artifact is then the same set
# of files a dev checkout tar carries (host's scripts/build-component-tar.sh).
.github/ export-ignore
scripts/ export-ignore
.gitattributes export-ignore
